window.products.push({"id":1131158,"name":"GaiaMade Handwoven Rattan Basket With Lid, Natural Wicker Storage Basket with Detachable Divider for Organizing, Large Wicker Basket With Lid for Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UXrlVrRzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTI-FUNCTIONAL AND DETACHABLE DESIGN. Our woven storage basket with a detachable divider can be adjusted according to your need. The rattan basket can be divided into 2 small compartments, or used as one large storage bin. The fit-in lid makes the woven basket privates storage space, and also works as a separated tray. ORGANIZED AND SPACE-SAVING. The spacious rattan baskets for storage are the solution to organize and easy to access for any room in your house such as laundry room, bathroom, kitchen, living room, entertainment room. The woven storage basket with lid storage basket is big enough to store your essentials like clothes, towels, throw blankets, toilet paper, etc. RUSTIC AND COZY DECORATION. Our durable and sturdy wicker storage basket with lid has a neutral tan color adding vintage and country vibe to any room in your house. The large storage baskets are ideal decor pieces for vintage, farmhouse, tropical, rustic, coastal, contemporary, and bohemian themes. THOUGHTFUL GIFTS. Our lidded basket is the ideal gift for your family and friends for different occasions including house warming, baby shower, birthday, wedding, etc. The wicker storage baskets are a useful and meaningful gift for organization and decoration. PROUDLY MADE IN VIETNAM. Each rattan storage basket is hand-woven with passion and outstanding craftsmanship by Vietnamese artisans, using 100% eco-friendly and durable rattan. We take great care in selecting these materials to ensure the quality of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UXrlVrRzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAIAMADE","source_asin":"B0BF8V3MGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF8V3MGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF8V3MGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1131159,"name":"The Bridge (A platinum print and book set)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714CxGHZ-FL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"New York was an obvious theme that John Wood, 21st Editions Editor and co-founder, gravitated toward. Our previous collaborations with Sheila Metzner in \"The Journal of Contemporary Photography, Volumes II and V,\" helped us to understand the life-long and very close connection that Sheila had with Brooklyn, the Brooklyn Bridge, and New York, not unlike Walt Whitman and Hart Crane, poets of the two greatest epic poems on America ever composed. It was with Sheila's great enthusiasm and excitement that she accepted John's proposal to be paired with Hart Crane for \"The Bridge.\" This print and book set includes 1 loose, fully signed, platinum print, plus a handbound book with an additional 12 bound platinum prints and Hart Crane's epic poem \"The Bridge.\" The book is printed letterpress and bound in full leather with hand-painted paste papers. The set is presented in a cloth and paper clamshell case.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714CxGHZ-FL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B00L9E36XE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L9E36XE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L9E36XE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1131160,"name":"Bolylight LED Table Lamp Birch Money Tree Holder Night Light Centerpieces Great Decoration for Home/Christmas/Party/Festival/Wedding, 1.5ft Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GvJM7M3NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We will try our best to ensure you are satisfied with your purchase!   Great Decoration For Your Home and Garden - Looking: Emulational and natural looking - Light: The LED lights are pretty, beautiful, nice, bright and will give a warm feeling to the room - Branch: Out of the box, you will need to shape it. The branches are bendable, which make this task easy - Multi-function: It's a reasonable design for the indoor and outdoor use, suitable for many occasions. Note - 1. The whole tree is wrapped with tape. After bending tree for DIY shapes for many times, the tapes in the forks of the tree might tear - 2. The led tree can be used for many years, we are not sure as each customer may use their LED tree in different circumstances. - 3. Please allow 0.3\"-0.9\" in size error due to manual measurement - 4. Please allow little color difference due to the monitor and light brightness - 5. The base is non-watertight.   Best Regards","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GvJM7M3NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bolylight","source_asin":"B09JG2HZMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JG2HZMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JG2HZMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1131161,"name":"One Tree Ornament 4 inch Dream Catcher Glass Crystal Beaded Christmas Fair Trade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WsbcWYmQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"One (1) dream catcher tree ornament 4 x 7 hand made assortment glass beads and crystal. This order is for one unique, one of a kind piece dream catcher. Dream Catchers are an ancient spiritual tool used to help assure good dreams to those that sleep under them. A dream catcher is usually placed over a place you would sleep where the morning light can hit it. As you sleep all dreams from the spirit world have to pass through the dream catcher.Only good dreams can pass through the hole in the center while the bad dreams are caught in the webbing and are destroyed by the morning light.A wonderful dream catcher 4 inches in diameter made of glass beads by artisans in Santiago de Atitlan, Guatemala.Priced directly from the artisan at $ 9.99 Made in the Guatemala fairly traded by artisans in Santiago de Atitlan.Dream catchers have been apart of Native American Indian culture for centuries. Many Native tribes would fashion a woven web or use an old net or snare as the center of the catcher. They would the decorate the webbed center with sacred items such as feathers, hides and beads. The belief is said these sacred items would attract good spirits and the web would Catch bad spirits preventing them from effecting you both in your sleep and beyond. These dream catcher are made in the tradition of the originals. Each center hoop is decorated with very fine glass and crystal beads which has a woven web center. Each dream catcher is then decorated with fine quality decorative bead dangles that hang below the symbolic web. Hang our dream catchers from above your bed or anywhere to promote good spirituality and to prevent bad spirits from coming your way! Each dream catcher features a 4 web and measures nearly 10 top to bottom! Color ships assorted. Very limited production- Compare at $ 19.95 each","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WsbcWYmQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unknown","source_asin":"B01N4N0LZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N4N0LZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N4N0LZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
