window.products.push({"id":1131177,"name":"MerryNine Professional Photography Crystal Ball, K9 Crystal Glass Ball with Pouch (90mm, K9, with Pouch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6180LslVb5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why do we choose a crystal ball made of K9? ✔K9 crystal is one of the highest quality Optical Glass. The material of K9 is more transparent than other materials, and it is not easy to Have impurities. How to shoot with MerryNine's crystal ball? ☀The focus should be on the crystal ball to make the scene in the crystal ball clear. ☀ Use a large aperture, background blur, blur. ☀The crystal ball such as a convex lens, can compress a wide scene and display it as a fisheye or a macro to enlarge the object, and the scenery presented is inverted. Br> ☀After the photography is finished, you can put the crystal ball in our gift storage pouch to protect your crystal ball. ☺Hold your crystal ball,get the most out of your photography! Why choose Merrynine? ♔--Professional crystal ball brand sellers, paying attention to the crystal ball industry for many years. ♥--We Understand your needs. Sellers, we have given you a crystal ball, a ball cloth and a storage bag, so that you can better show your crystal ball. ☎--After the worry-free sale, you can contact us at any time, No matter if you have any questions or dissatisfaction. We will give you a satisfactory reply. ♬Feature: Crystal Ball Size (MM): 90 ♬Suitable for: Decorations for house, office, restaurant, party, banquet, stores or Props for photography ✉Package Includes: 1 X Crystal Ball1 X Crystal Ball Pouch (GIFT) ▲Note : Please avoid prolonged exposure to direct sunlight. The clear crystal ball will act like a magnifying glass and will start a fire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6180LslVb5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MerryNine","source_asin":"B07MT8HCMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MT8HCMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MT8HCMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
