window.products.push({"id":1131237,"name":"Glass and Stainless Steel Seasoning Cruets with Caddy 4 Piece Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71le2k-MuqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Instantly become a more seasoned hostess. Whether you’re serving dinner for family or hosting a more extensive gathering of friends, this sleek 5-piece set from the ORIGINAL 5TH AVENUE COLLECTION is the perfect way to showcase everyone’s favorite seasonings and condiments while adding an element of simple elegance to your gracious table. With four cruets total, this set caters to even the most diverse group of guests. Now you can be a smart and seasoned hostess who never forgets that some may like their dishes with an extra pinch of salt, pepper, oil, or vinegar. 2 Smaller & 2 Larger Cruets The two smaller cruets hold ground pepper and table salt, and feature triple-slit covers for a smooth and even seasoning motion. The two larger cruets hold oil and vinegar, and feature easy-pour spouts that sit flat with each cap’s opening. Premium Materials & Build To ensure your cruets last from one Thanksgiving dinner to the next, we’ve used high-quality 18/10-grade stainless steel and crystal-clear glass. The steel is finished to a gleaming polish, while the slits and cap openings are precision machined. Neat Carry Caddy Included Rounding out this 5-piece set is a sleek stainless steel caddy that adds the perfect modern accent to any table setting. The upright caddy houses all four cruets, featuring a loop-like grab handle for neat serving and mobility between meals. For Home Cooks & Pro Chefs Everyone from the humble homemaker to the ritzy restaurateur can appreciate this cruet set’s well-balanced design and just-right size. Measuring 4” x 2” x 7”, it’s equally perfect for restaurant tables, homey kitchens, and formal dining rooms. Complete Set is Dishwasher Safe While all pieces are dishwasher safe, hand washing them with warm water and soap followed by hand drying will guarantee fewer streaks and increase lifespan. Light polishing with glass cleaner and a soft towel will also keep the steel’s sparkle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71le2k-MuqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5th Ave Store","source_asin":"B00Y1LT2CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y1LT2CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y1LT2CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
