window.products.push({"id":1131377,"name":"Utheer Gas Fireplace Logs Set Ceramic White Birch Log for Gas Fireplace, Outdoor Firebowl, Electric Gas Fireplaces, Vented, Linear Fire Pits Ceramic F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gBrXdLjrL._AC_SL1194_.jpg","description":"🔥【Dimension】► Each gas fireplace log is about 15.7-16.1 inches long x 2.6 to 4.7 inches in diameter. 【Package】► Package included 6pcs birch fireplace logs, we ship in a molded foam package to keep your logs safe during transit 🔥【Safe and Non-toxic】► The white birch logs for fireplace decorative are made of highly durable ceramic fibers, it can sustain high temperature, which can keep fire pit logs in a good shape, won't burn itself. Design not to scratch or scuff the surface of the fireplace, each fireplace logs has been carefully sculpted to perfection to imitate the true beauty of nature while availing to our eco-friendly world. lt is nontoxic, smokeless, ashless on fire, give you a health experience 🔥【Using Tips】► Improper placement of ceramic fireplace logs for fireplace can lead to inadequate gas combustion and cause birch gas fireplace logs to turn black. To prevent birch logs from turning black in the fireplace, then you need to adjust the placement of birch fireplace logs so that each ceramic fireplace log has a minimum contact area and even internal air circulation. We recommend using fire glass and glowing embers with it to give your fireplace and fire pit an artistic touch 🔥【Widespreas Use】► Ideal for vented gas fireplace, outdoor gas fireplaces, indoor gas fireplaces, direct vent, zero clearance, natural gas, gel, standard fire pits, fake fireplaces, electric fireplace inserts, propane fireplaces, propane fire pits, ethanol fireplaces, gel fireplaces, old school fire pit, modern fire table, etc. Or you can use these ceramic logs for gas fireplace to decorate around the house 🔥【Super Realistic】► Using our ceramic gas logs for fireplace, you'll quickly forget the inconvenient days of burning real wood. Porous ceramic fiber emits the heat from the fire brilliantly. Much warmer than cut glass or cement logs. Make you enjoy the natural heat of a fire inside or outside. These ceramic wood logs look just like real wood logs,you’ll even see some orange or red hot spots under the logs 🔥【Professional After-Sales Guarantee】► If you have any questions about the product, please contact us in time, our professional after-sales team is at your service, Help you solve the problem in the shortest time so please feel free to buy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gBrXdLjrL._AC_SL1194_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Utheer","source_asin":"B0819LMPDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0819LMPDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0819LMPDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
