window.products.push({"id":1131582,"name":"Balloon Garland & Arch Kit with Foil Moon & Star Balloon| 12Ft 57 Pcs Pink, White, Blush Pink, Foil, Purple and Chrome Red Latex Balloons Set for Baby","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OhJpmp7HL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","description":"★OUR PRODUCTS: Our balloon arch product is about 12 Ft long. If you're celebrating a wedding, bridal shower or baby shower, this garland is a must have! Since we make it so easy for you by providing everything, you'll absolutely need to assemble and display your garland. These high quality latex balloons are packaged into a beautiful gift package. These elaborately packaged balloons can be used as gifts for your friends and family. Make an amazing 12-foot-long balloon wreath or arch kit with everything you need. ★YOU WILL RECEIVE: (57) Mix of 30 inch, 18 inch, 16 inch, 12 inch,10 inch, 5 inch premium latex balloons in Pink, White, Blush Pink, Foil, Purple and Chrome Red - super simple to put together and bound to be the center piece of your event! Grab your DIY balloon garland kit. 1 X Roll of Balloon Connecting Strip Is 5 m/ 16 Feet 2 X Balloon Tying Tools 1 X Roll 32 Ft Ribbon 2 X 100 Pieces Glue Points ★ASSEMBLING YOUR BALLOONS: Depending on garland size, assembly can take anywhere from an hour to two hours. Please plan ahead. Tip 1: MAKE SURE YOU HAVE AT LEAST ONE HAND PUMP! Blow up 5 inch balloons and Chrome balloons with hand pump. However we suggest you to pump large balloons (10 inch, 12 inch, 18 inch and 30 inch)with electric pump since it will save your time. Tip 2: Tie and pinch the 5 inch, 10 inch and 12 inch balloons to the holes on balloon strip first, then go other ones. As you attaching balloons, make sure you alternate sides of balloon strip and attach different colors accordingly. Tip 3: At last, evenly attach 30 inch, 18 inch light pink four-pointed star and specialty balloons such as Nude or Pink five-pointed star chrome balloons to the garland with glue dots, to create the best results! Tip 4: If you wanna make more gorgeous looking, add some eucalyptus, curling ribbon, flower","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OhJpmp7HL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XmasExp","source_asin":"B07ZK7KJ8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZK7KJ8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZK7KJ8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
