window.products.push({"id":1131907,"name":"Black & Decker FP1450 Quick'n Easy 450-Watt 8-Cup Food Processor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711+PUQxcfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With its powerful 450-watt motor, this convenient food processor helps to reduce prep time in the kitchen. The unit provides an 8-cup work bowl and a stainless-steel chopping blade for coarsely or finely chopping, mincing, mixing, or pureeing food. It also comes with a reversible stainless-steel slicing/shredding disk and a food chute with a pusher for slicing cabbage to make coleslaw or for shredding cheese to sprinkle over a homemade pizza. Chop, slice, or shred directly into the work bowl or use the continuous-flow side chute to slice up large quantities of food like potatoes or carrots into a separate container. Its user-friendly control dial offers low and high speed settings, plus \"pulse\" to deliver an extra burst of power when needed. For safety, the appliance provides an interlock system, which prevents the food processor from operating unless the work bowl and cover are properly locked into place. Other highlights include a continuous flow stopper to direct food into the work bowl, a storage lid, cord wrap, and dishwasher-safe parts for quick cleanup. The food processor measures approximately 10-1/5 by 10-1/5 by 15-1/5 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711+PUQxcfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACK+DECKER","source_asin":"B002EX86MU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002EX86MU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002EX86MU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1131908,"name":"Rock and Roll 50's Soda Shop Party Decorations Bundle - Includes Tablecover, Banner, Streamer, and Centerpiece for Nostalgic 1950's Theme","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vn5weu+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get ready to rock and roll with our Rock and Roll 50's Soda Shop Party Decorations Bundle! This bundle includes four essential items to create an authentic 1950's soda shop atmosphere for your party. First up, we have a 54-inch by 108-inch plastic table cover, designed to fit most standard tables. With its vibrant and nostalgic soda shop theme, it sets the perfect backdrop for your party decor. Whether you're hosting your event indoors or outdoors, this durable plastic table cover is up to the task. Next, we have a 5-foot plastic Rock & Roll banner that adds a touch of vintage charm to your party. Featuring classic 1950's imagery and lettering, this banner sets the mood and welcomes your guests to a blast from the past. Hang it up in your party area to instantly transport your guests to the heyday of rock and roll. To add even more retro flair, we've included an 8-foot plastic vinyl records streamer. This eye-catching decoration features vibrant vinyl record cutouts, creating a dynamic and playful atmosphere. Hang it across walls or doorways to enhance the nostalgic ambiance of your event. Last but not least, our 3-D radio centerpiece is a nifty addition to your table decor. Measuring 5.75 inches by 9.5 inches, this centerpiece is printed on all sides, allowing your guests to enjoy its charm from every angle. Its attention to detail and retro design will surely impress your guests. Whether you're hosting a 1950's-themed birthday party, a sock hop, or a soda shop-inspired gathering, our Rock and Roll 50's Soda Shop Party Decorations Bundle has you covered. Set the stage for a memorable event with these quality plastic decorations that capture the essence of the era. Get ready to twist and shout with this nostalgic party bundle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vn5weu+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07QG46VHP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1131908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QG46VHP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QG46VHP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
